# This content is from "SiliconFlow.md", line 19
msgctxt "chunk_0ACD2D6C"
msgid "1. Select \"SiliconFlowFree\" from the \"Translation Options\" - \"Service\" dropdown list.\n2. Click the Translate button at the bottom of the page to start translation.\n3. After translation is complete, you can find the translated PDF file in the \"Translated\" section at the bottom of the page.\n\n"
msgstr "1. 从「Translation Options」-「Service」下拉列表中选择「SiliconFlowFree」。  \n2. 点击页面底部的「Translate」按钮开始翻译。  \n3. 翻译完成后，您可以在页面底部的「Translated」部分找到翻译好的 `PDF` 文件。\n\n"

# This content is from "SiliconFlow.md", line 24
msgctxt "chunk_24653E80"
msgid "### Privacy Policy\n"
msgstr "### 隐私政策\n"

# This content is from "SiliconFlow.md", line 26
msgctxt "chunk_E40E083F"
msgid "The file content will be sent to the server of the project maintainer [@OpenX123](https://github.com/OpenX123), and then forwarded to SiliconFlow for translation.\n\nThe maintainers of this project will only collect error information returned by SiliconFlow for debugging related services. Your file content will not be collected.\n\nSiliconFlow Privacy Policy: [简体中文](https://docs.siliconflow.cn/cn/legals/privacy-policy)/[English](https://docs.siliconflow.cn/en/legals/privacy-policy)\n\n\n"
msgstr "文件内容将被发送至项目维护者 [@OpenX123](https://github.com/OpenX123) 的服务器，随后转发至 SiliconFlow 进行翻译。\n\n本项目维护者仅会收集 SiliconFlow 返回的错误信息用于调试相关服务，不会收集您的文件内容。\n\nSiliconFlow 隐私政策：[简体中文](https://docs.siliconflow.cn/cn/legals/privacy-policy)/[English](https://docs.siliconflow.cn/en/legals/privacy-policy)\n\n\n"

# This content is from "SiliconFlow.md", line 34
msgctxt "chunk_86238772"
msgid "## Use other models from SiliconFlow\n"
msgstr "## 使用 SiliconFlow 的其他模型\n"

# This content is from "SiliconFlow.md", line 36
msgctxt "chunk_6C8B20F2"
msgid "[SiliconFlow](https://siliconflow.cn) also provides other models for translation.\n"
msgstr "[SiliconFlow](https://siliconflow.cn) 还提供了其他用于翻译的模型。\n"

# This content is from "SiliconFlow.md", line 40
msgctxt "chunk_71BE5099"
msgid "1. Register an account at [SiliconFlow](https://siliconflow.cn)\n\n2. Create an API key at [SiliconFlow API Key](https://cloud.siliconflow.cn/me/account/ak). Then, click on the key to copy it.\n"
msgstr "1. 在 [SiliconFlow](https://siliconflow.cn) 注册账号\n\n2. 在 [SiliconFlow API Key](https://cloud.siliconflow.cn/me/account/ak) 创建 API 密钥。然后，点击密钥进行复制。\n"

# This content is from "SiliconFlow.md", line 52
msgctxt "chunk_22AE44AB"
msgid "1. \"Translation Options\" - **\"Service\"** dropdown list: Select \"SiliconFlow\"\n2. \"Translation Options\" - **\"Base URL for SiliconFlow API\"**: Keep default\n3. \"Translation Options\" - **\"SiliconFlow model to use\"**: Enter \"Pro/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3\" or other models\n4. \"Translation Options\" - **\"API key for SiliconFlow service\"**: Paste your API key\n5. Click the Translate button at the bottom of the page to start translation\n6. After translation is complete, you can find the translated PDF file in the \"Translated\" section at the bottom of the page.\n\n"
msgstr "1. \"翻译选项\" - **\"服务\"** 下拉列表：选择 \"SiliconFlow\"\n2. \"翻译选项\" - **\"SiliconFlow API 基础 URL\"**：保持默认\n3. \"翻译选项\" - **\"要使用的 SiliconFlow 模型\"**：输入 \"Pro/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3\" 或其他模型\n4. \"翻译选项\" - **\"SiliconFlow 服务的 API 密钥\"**：粘贴您的 API 密钥\n5. 点击页面底部的翻译按钮开始翻译\n6. 翻译完成后，您可以在页面底部的 \"已翻译\" 部分找到翻译好的 PDF 文件。\n\n"

