# This content is from "advanced.md", line 105
msgctxt "chunk_23D405EC"
msgid "When using translation services, proper rate limiting configuration is crucial to avoid API errors and optimize performance. This guide explains how to configure `--qps` and `--pool-max-worker` parameters based on different upstream service limitations.\n"
