# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 1
msgctxt "chunk_D0E62F41"
msgid "# Suggesting Improvements to the Documentation Translations\n"
msgstr "# 文档翻译改进建议\n"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 3
msgctxt "chunk_5E99F395"
msgid "Thank you for your interest in this project! The non‑English documentation is automatically translated by large language models, so mistakes are inevitable. If you notice issues in a language you are familiar with, we warmly welcome your suggestions for improvement.\n\nBefore you start contributing, please take a moment to read the following guide to help ensure your suggestions can be smoothly accepted.\n"
msgstr "感谢您对本项目的关注！非英文文档由大语言模型自动翻译，因此错误在所难免。如果您在熟悉的语言中发现问题，我们热忱欢迎您提出改进建议。\n\n在开始贡献之前，请花点时间阅读以下指南，以确保您的建议能够顺利被采纳。\n"

